{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Tessera 是一款將鬧鐘轉化為放鬆照片拼圖的 App。它能讓你每天早上透過拼湊一張喜愛的照片來喚醒自己，取代傳統的貪睡按鈕或困難挑戰，適合希望以溫馨方式展開新一天的用戶。原價 US $0.99，目前限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>溫馨照片拼圖鬧鐘</h2>\n<p>Tessera 提供 Arrange 和 Sliding 兩種拼圖模式，你可以從相機膠卷中選擇家人、伴侶、寵物或旅行回憶等照片設為鬧鐘圖案。完成拼圖後，你會有一段安靜的時光欣賞完整照片，然後才開始新的一天。App 透過 Apple AlarmKit 支援靜音模式與專注模式，並能在鎖定螢幕和動態島顯示即時動態。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1178-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1179-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1180-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1181-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1182-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1183-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Tessera: Photo Puzzle Alarm</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T01:14:02.841393+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":334,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}